TI  - BAB software framework and micro-service technology as the basis for cooperative process-aware information systems on the Java platform
ST  - Softverski okvir BAB i tehnologija mikro-servisa kao osnove za kooperativne procesno-svesne informacione sisteme na Java platformi
PY  - 2026
T2  - Military Technical Courier/Vojnotehnicki glasnik
VL  - 74
